# dsh-web-relay — 托管块起点，块外内容原样保留。
# 只放 Match User relay 段落：全局认证策略属于主机管理员，插件不碰。
# BEGIN dsh-web-relay
Match User relay
    AllowTcpForwarding remote
    PermitOpen none
    GatewayPorts no
    X11Forwarding no
    AllowAgentForwarding no
    PermitTunnel no
    PermitTTY no
    ForceCommand /usr/sbin/nologin
# END dsh-web-relay
